.TH taur-admin 1  "taur-admin " 
.SH NAME
taur\-admin \- Grant (or with \-\-revoke, remove) site\-admin rights: accept requests, manage any package
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtaur admin\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-revoke\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Grant (or with \-\-revoke, remove) site\-admin rights: accept requests, manage any package
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<HOME>\fR
Data directory (default: $TAUR_HOME, else ~/.local/share/taur)
.TP
\fB\-\-revoke\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

